        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use, network access devices, certified electricity
The data set represents average values for one hour use of network access devices per work station.;
UUID: 7ac63b54-8f05-3423-8eac-bc477d17086a
This data set includes the use of internet access devices for one end user during one hour, taking into account device use and electricity consumption (certified electricity mix)
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Included devices: ADSL  modem with router (0.0042kW) and DSLAM (0.0013 kW) per end user
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7ac63b54-8f05-3423-8eac-bc477d17086a.xml</text>
